From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RTL8812AU Mesh Project <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 23:44:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] wifi: rtw88: use software crypto for mesh keys

The legacy rtw88 CAM path cannot represent per-peer mesh MGTK and IGTK
state. Advertise the cfg80211 admission flag for non-pairwise peer keys.
Then reject mesh key installation so mac80211 encrypts in software.

DISABLE_KEY must still succeed for a key that was never uploaded. This
keeps teardown idempotent and lets SAE/AMPE peers install key material
without claiming per-station GTK offload.
---
 drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw88/mac80211.c | 8 ++++++++
 drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw88/main.c     | 8 +++++++-
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw88/mac80211.c b/drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw88/mac80211.c
index 0b622d7..b89103b 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw88/mac80211.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw88/mac80211.c
@@ -564,6 +564,14 @@ static int rtw_ops_set_key(struct ieee80211_hw *hw, enum set_key_cmd cmd,
 	u8 hw_key_idx;
 	int ret = 0;
 
+	/* The legacy CAM/key-selection path does not model mesh per-peer keys.
+	 * Reject installation so mac80211 handles pairwise, MGTK and IGTK crypto
+	 * in software. A key rejected at SET_KEY is never uploaded, but honor the
+	 * mac80211 contract that DISABLE_KEY must succeed.
+	 */
+	if (vif->type == NL80211_IFTYPE_MESH_POINT)
+		return cmd == SET_KEY ? -EOPNOTSUPP : 0;
+
 	switch (key->cipher) {
 	case WLAN_CIPHER_SUITE_WEP40:
 		hw_key_type = RTW_CAM_WEP40;
diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw88/main.c b/drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw88/main.c
index 8150297..d970e91 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw88/main.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw88/main.c
@@ -2288,8 +2288,14 @@ int rtw_register_hw(struct rtw_dev *rtwdev, struct ieee80211_hw *hw)
 				     BIT(NL80211_IFTYPE_ADHOC);
 	if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_MAC80211_MESH) &&
 	    rtwdev->chip->id == RTW_CHIP_TYPE_8812A &&
-	    rtw_hci_type(rtwdev) == RTW_HCI_TYPE_USB)
+	    rtw_hci_type(rtwdev) == RTW_HCI_TYPE_USB) {
 		hw->wiphy->interface_modes |= BIT(NL80211_IFTYPE_MESH_POINT);
+		/* cfg80211 uses this legacy-named flag to admit any per-peer
+		 * non-pairwise key, including mesh MGTK/IGTK. Do not set
+		 * SUPPORTS_PER_STA_GTK: mesh keys remain in mac80211 software.
+		 */
+		hw->wiphy->flags |= WIPHY_FLAG_IBSS_RSN;
+	}
 	hw->wiphy->available_antennas_tx = hal->antenna_tx;
 	hw->wiphy->available_antennas_rx = hal->antenna_rx;
 
